# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
# 只忽略仓库根目录下的 lib/（Python 打包产物）。
# 原规则是 `lib/`，会连子目录一起吃掉 —— 结果 dsh-plugin/lib/（插件源码）
# 被静默忽略，第一个 commit 里的插件根本没有代码。别改回去。
/lib/
# 全局 gitignore（core.excludesFile）里还有一条 `lib/`，同样会吃掉子目录。
# 仓库内的规则优先级更高，这里显式取反把插件源码捞回来。
!dsh-plugin/lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

